stage: cfg→ssa (panics inside decode_function called before SSA construction)
panic: unsupported bytecode version 25088
site: src/opcodes.rs:9857:14
repro: cargo fuzz run fuzz_ssa fuzz/crashes/fuzz_ssa/0ee9925d6f02

Same root cause as `fuzz_cfg/15e6a48b0466` — parser accepts arbitrary u32
versions but the opcode schema lookup panics outside the supported set. In
fuzz_ssa the panic fires before SSA construction is reached, so this target
is effectively blocked on the same fix until hermes-hardening lands. Once
the version panic is converted to a typed Err, fuzz_ssa will resume
exploring the SSA construction path.
